OL,3,GNEWSASTACK Leisure scraps plans for two
OL,4,Anew venues
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for two major leisure venues have
OL,7,Fbeen scrapped, years after work started
OL,8,Fon them.
OL,10,FSTACK Leisure has shelved the plans for
OL,11,Ffood, drink and entertainment venues in
OL,12,FWhitley Bay and Durham.
OL,14,FThe company blamed the "difficult"
OL,15,Fdecision on unforeseen development
OL,16,Fcosts, slow planning and legal
OL,17,Fprocesses, infrastructure demands and
OL,18,Fwider pressures on the hospitality and
OL,19,Fleisure industries.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
