OL,3,GNEWSASTACK Leisure scraps plans for two
OL,4,Anew venues
OL,5,
OL,6,FCEO Neill Winch said: "We recognise
OL,7,Fthat there will be a huge amount of
OL,8,Fdisappointment about these decisions."
